magento2	email	core_config_data	system/smtp/disable	medium	0	Email sending is on (system/smtp/disable is not set)	Set system/smtp/disable to 1 in the copy, or route mail to a catcher such as Mailpit	send email	Email sending is on (system/smtp/disable is not set)
magento2	email	sales_order		high	7	7 order emails are queued; with asynchronous sending, staging cron would send them to customers	Set send_email = 0 on unsent orders in the copy	email customers	7 order emails are queued; with asynchronous sending, staging cron would send them to customers
magento2	payments	core_config_data	payment/braintree	high	0	Payment method "braintree" is active in live mode	Switch it to sandbox or test mode and replace the live credentials in the copy	take live payments	Payment method "braintree" is active in live mode
magento2	scheduled_jobs	cron_schedule		medium	50	50 pending cron jobs would run on staging (most common: sales_send_order_emails (24), indexer_reindex_all_invalid (17), newsletter_send_all (9))	Empty cron_schedule in the copy and keep cron off until the copy is checked	run cron jobs	50 pending cron jobs would run on staging
